#Secondary Weapons
; Trebuchet is the one bomber-carried missile that is not a retail "Bomb" torpedo
; yet hits a command station for more than a Cyclops. It shares the siege-torpedo
; damage type so RTS Command Hull scales it the same way; ship damage is unchanged.
; core/tools/test_table_references.py audits this list.
$Name: Trebuchet
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Siege Torpedo
$Shockwave damage type: RTS Siege Torpedo
$Dinky shockwave:
+Shockwave damage type: RTS Siege Torpedo
#End
